        <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classTree_1_1PreOrderIterator" kindref="compound">PreOrderIterator</ref> creates an iterator to enumerate the tree nodes in pre-order. If this is the first time a pre-order traversal has been demanded for this tree, or the tree has changed since the last pre-order traversal, a pre-order walk is carried out using the recursive method create_preorder_links. This links up the nodes in pre-order and subsequent pre-order traversals simply follow the links. </para>        </detaileddescription>
